WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:04.170
Hi, everyone, Kaleido Star
is about to start.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.710
When you watch Kaleido Star,

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.310
please keep your room brightly lit

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.610
and sit as far as from the TV you can.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.380
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.410
Have you ever created something
with your friends?

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.850
Working hard toward the same goal,

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.720
cooperating with all sorts of people

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.920
and helping each other makes you feel good.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.830
Please support our new show.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.390
Please support! Please support!

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:35.740
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:35.740
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.240
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.240
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:45.940
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:45.940
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:53.990 --> 00:01:00.300
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:53.990 --> 00:01:00.300
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:06.670
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:06.670
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:15.380
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:15.380
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:21.870
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:21.870
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:28.620
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:28.620
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.230
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.230
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:36.770
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:36.770
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.800
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.800
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:46.310
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:46.310
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:56.780
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:56.780
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.990
It's amazing how time passes by so quickly.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:08.920
It's already been two weeks
since we moved in here.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.000
And yet, not only are we far from
creating our own Kaleido Stage,

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.230
but also we have no jobs.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:17.860
I told my mother and father
not to worry, but...

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:21.340
I wish we could practice some place
a little bigger than here, don't you?

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.210
Yes, I do.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:25.310
I wish something like a dream happens.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.350
Right, right. Something like a dream...

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.280
Wow... It's like a dream all right...

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.220
What's wrong, Sora?

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:35.510
I just thought I'd try combining
tightrope walking and the cushion throw.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.360
Anyway, Mia, Anna, please make sure
no one sees your panties.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.720
We're all girls here. So who cares?

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:44.230
Yeah...

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.770
No, NO!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:46.840
What are you gonna do

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.670
if a peeping Tom or a perverted spirit
is watching us?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.570
Who are you calling a perverted spirit?

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:55.610
An Amazing Change From Zero to Hero

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.680
An Amazing Change From Zero to Hero

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.680
"An Amazing Change From Zero to Hero"

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.580
An Amazing Change From Zero to Hero

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:09.580
Oh, and Yuri's Kaleido Stage was to face
the colorful opening date today.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.590
What shall we do?

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:13.600
Shall we go?

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.030
He took the trouble
to send invitations. It means...

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.360
Harassment?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.370
No... This could be a challenge...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.130
Want to go?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.540
Everyone,

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.130
Kaleido Stage has been reborn.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.080
The show we're aiming at

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.670
is a fantastic show
which never existed before.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:39.790
Now, the revolutionary flame is ready
to blaze up in entertainment.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.590
It looks like they spent a lot of money.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.360
I wonder if he did this to rub it in our faces.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.200
I co-starred with Miss Layla on that stage.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.620
Everyone did their best,

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.550
and we received enthusiastic applause
from the audience.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.820
But... this is no longer our Kaleido Stage.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:29.970
It was fun!

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:30.640
It was like I was in an amusement park.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.940
It was great!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.940
It was like I was in an amusement park.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:35.710
What's wrong, Sora?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.610
What?

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:38.080
Are you looking for somebody?

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.450
Yes.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.810
I just thought Miss Layla
might be here also.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.850
Yeah, she could be here.

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:47.250
I assume she also got an invitation.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.580
But she could be busy.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.130
It seems she's doing another movie.
It was in the magazine.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.820
I guess she's not doing
stage shows anymore.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.260
I just can't...

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.530
I just can't see that happening.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.090
Oh, it's Yuri.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.240
Mr. Yuri, can I have your autograph, please?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.040
All right.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.740
Me too.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.640
Okay. Wait one second.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.650
Why do we have to hide?

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:30.560
You want to take a chance and rent
the Empire Stage for $350 a day?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.640
If we rent it for three days,
we'll be broke.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:38.210
Unless we can find a place much cheaper
and rent the place at least for ten days,

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:40.410
our reputation will not have time to spread.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.940
Hm... I see...

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:43.740
Oh!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.850
Did you find a good job?

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:50.420
"Wanted: performers to participate
in the opening event

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.390
of a giant seafood restaurant."

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.880
They pay pretty well too.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.490
Sounds good.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:56.350
Yes.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.630
But it says that you have to audition.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:05:59.820
We're more than happy to audition!

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.630
Then you want to try their audition?

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:04.830
Yeah!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:12.210
So this is it. Everyone, are you ready?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.070
Of course!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.140
Let's get the job by all means!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:17.770
Get!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:18.540
Get!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:19.580
Get!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.210
Passed!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.080
We did it!

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.190
Oh...

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.490
Welcome.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.560
If all we had to do was wear this
and hand out balloons,

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.190
we didn't need to audition.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.990
At least you're in a crab costume.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.930
On the other hand,
I'm a shrimp, a shrimp.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:44.540
Anyhow, both of you, motivate yourselves
and let's do our best.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.340
Yeah!

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.140
There, there, there!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.110
I'm spinning more than usual.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.110
Mia!

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.410
Yeah!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.820
There, there, there, there, there, there!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:03.290
There!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:12.630
What are you doing detaining
customers at the entrance?

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.600
Please let customers
go inside the restaurant.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.800
You guys are supposed to be
delicious ingredients.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:17.740
Yes.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.240
Please...

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.780
Eat...

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.210
Delicious us!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.580
Please!

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.210
Instead of doing all that,

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.380
I just want you to hand out balloons.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.120
Then why did you audition us?

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.120
Mia, smile, smile.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.790
Right now, it's taking a little time
to be seated.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.190
You're better off than I am.
'Cause you're a crab.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.000
I, on the other hand, am a shrimp.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.690
You too, Anna!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.200
Even if you tell me to smile...

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.480
Why don't you try some delicious seafood?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:58.880
Yuri...

00:07:58.880 --> 00:07:59.710
What?!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:00.510
You must be kidding.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.980
What are you doing?!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.650
Oh... Well...

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.210
Oh, sorry.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.340
You look so perfect in that costume.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.470
I just can't help myself...

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:29.740
Sora...

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.610
Mr. Yuri Killian, are you all right, sir?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.210
Oh, I'm fine.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:38.620
I'm very sorry. I reserved you a special seat.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.550
So, please come this way.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.220
You're fired.

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:46.860
Of all people, we just had
to be seen dressed like that

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.460
by the person we least wanted to be seen by.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:49.530
If I were in a crab costume,
it would be better.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.760
But why do I have to be seen
in a shrimp costume?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.500
Yes.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.000
Who?

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.600
I'm back!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.450
Miss Sarah!

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:11.720
When I asked Mr. Policeman,
he told me you were here.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.950
So I came right over.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.110
There we go.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.160
This is a nice room.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.300
Did you finish your training?

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.260
Yes.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:23.920
There is nothing like the "Unryu" style
when a sumo wrestler parades in the ring.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.530
Didn't you go to training for singing?

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:28.530
Are you kidding? I trained for Sumo.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.870
Anyhow, seeing your faces calms me down.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.110
Miss Sarah,

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.480
don't you need to go back to Boss?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.540
What? To Kalos? Why?

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:42.880
Why? 'Cause... You know...

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.650
Yeah, you know...

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:48.060
I haven't talked to Kalos in a while.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:48.850
What?!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.550
I think he's taking some time by himself
thinking about his future.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.860
You think? Aren't you worried about him?

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:56.700
Worry?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.560
Being unfaithful or something...

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.300
I don't need to worry about that.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.740
Thanks to what happened the other day,

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:07.270
I found out Kalos is still
head over heels in love with me.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.080
By the way, I found you a job.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.410
What?!

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.150
Look at this.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:18.710
"Want performers who perform on the
open stage at Marine Park"?

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.120
I just happened to find this
in passing while I was in town.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:25.390
So, I went to Marine Park,
thinking I had nothing to lose.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.530
Then I was able to sign a
temporary agreement with them.

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:28.320
That was fast!

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:31.800
But, it's only for one day,
the day after tomorrow.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.130
The day after tomorrow?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:39.730
The group that is performing right now
suddenly can't perform that day.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:45.150
So they're going to remove
the current set at night.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.740
Because of this, you don't
have time for rehearsal either.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.010
What do you think?

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.150
Of course we'll do it. Right?

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.720
Yeah. We have no reasons to reject it. Right?

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:01.160
If we could get a good reputation,
they may ask us back next time too.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.300
Thank you!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.490
I'm glad you like it.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:09.260
Anyhow, you should take a shower
and take a rest.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.400
That's a good idea.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:12.670
Take your time.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:15.210
Hey! I haven't done anything...

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.680
yet...

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:18.440
What are we gonna do?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.880
If it's the day after tomorrow,

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:23.750
we don't have enough time to create
anything with a story.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.150
Then you want keep it simple
and just do a performance?

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:30.020
Hey, I wonder if we could contact
the cast members from "Freedom"?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.430
Oh, good idea. I'll e-mail them right away.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.120
Oh... Miss Layla too...

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:40.560
I think we should contact Miss Layla too.
Don't you think so?

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:45.070
Miss Layla...
I don't know if she's interested.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:48.810
Yeah... But if Sora wants to do it...

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.240
Right. Shall we visit Miss Layla's house?

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.610
Yes.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:12.730
So, we want to create a new Kaleido Stage.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:16.290
And we thought it would be nice
if you could join us.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:19.510
I have a camera test for the
movie later today.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.740
Then tomorrow, I have a costume fitting.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:24.310
There's no way I'd have time
for anything like that.

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:28.370
First of all, my father is
managing my schedule right now.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.220
Really?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.620
Then, you're...

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.120
I only do my best in the situation
I'm in right now.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.090
You haven't done your
last show yet, have you?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:46.060
I... I still want to appear on
stage with you, Miss Layla.

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:48.670
Sora.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.160
Yes?

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.330
Did you gain weight?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.550
It seems you still don't
understand how hard it is

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:00.810
to get everything back if you
skip your training even one day.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.580
Sorry...

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:11.130
It seems Miss Layla started walking
a different path from us.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:14.060
Miss Layla has her own battle.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.030
Yes.

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.200
If you act now,

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.400
this three-volume instruction video

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.530
is yours for only $200!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.070
I want to get them!

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:25.210
We're back.

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:27.570
Welcome back. How was she?

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:28.740
As expected, Miss Layla cannot do it.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.440
Argh!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.440
As expected, Miss Layla cannot do it.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.280
As expected, Miss Layla cannot do it.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:30.580
Argh!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:30.850
Argh!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:30.850
Really?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:31.610
Really?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.280
Well, it's disappointing, but what can we do?

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.550
We got some e-mail responses.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:39.490
Really?

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.820
From Elena, Jeanne, Claire...

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.080
and also from Emilio.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.990
Everyone's coming!

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:49.560
Really? Wow... All of a sudden,
I'm getting motivated.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.990
Even though it's only for one day,
we want to make it the best show.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.100
Oh!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.000
What?! What?!

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:57.370
Rosetta...

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:58.640
What?!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.380
It's been a long time.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.640
I've read your e-mail.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.910
I'll go there immediately. Rosetta

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.980
I never expected her to come,

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.010
but I sent her an e-mail just in case.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.350
